  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is projected from the ground with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> with horizontal so that its range and maximum height are equal, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;will be equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The range and the maximum height of the projectile are given as below,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p>As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
